      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5de9405aea7cc52772fcc359|full_name}: While not the same, a similar issue still occurs with v2.2.2 when migrating a 2019 non VCC project to VCC. It replaces the old unity package SDK with the latest 3.5.0 SDK. VCC showed the warning about detecting 2022 packages in in a 2019 project. Unlike the canny creator, I was unable to even open my project as it appeared to get stuck. I had to force close unity after waiting long enough and had to manually downgrade the SDK to open the project.",
