  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Because 3.5.0-beta.1 was renamed to 3.5.0 it is now installed by default when making a Unity 2019 Project.\n\nThis cause a warning on top of the screen ( We detected Unity 2022 SDK Packages in a Unity 2019 Project. You should try to migrate this project ).\n\nIt also causes a message to upgrade Unity API when opening the project.\n\nIt also causes the removal of Oculus Desktop and OpenVR Desktop when opening the project.\n\nIt also causes compilation errors.",
